      "template_id": "T_OUT_OF_REGION",
      "text": "你说的地方不在中国大陆。我能核对的官方来源以中国大陆法律为限，所以先不给条文定位；不过材料整理照样能做：合同里的押金约定、交接记录、双方的文字往来，都可以先按上面的清单准备。",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    },
    {
      "kind": "ACTION",
      "required_predicates": {
        "fact": "commercial_use",
        "op": "equals",
        "value": true
      },
      "review_refs": [],
      "semantic_sha256": "c015cf166985b017ec1f7ce9071200b8748f6df4e7a50de5388b4a9113f81e41",
      "slots": {},
      "source_refs": [],
      "template_id": "T_SCOPE_NONRESIDENTIAL_NAV",
      "text": "你说的是商铺、办公这类非住宅租赁。住宅租赁的专门规定不一定适用，我先把能做的材料整理做完：押金数额与返还时间的约定、扣减押金的情形、交接记录，以及你和对方的文字往来。",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    },
    {
      "kind": "ACTION",
      "required_predicates": {
        "of": [
          {
            "fact": "early_termination",
            "op": "equals",
            "value": true
          },
          {
            "fact": "sublet",
            "op": "equals",
            "value": true
          }
        ],
        "op": "any"
      },
      "review_refs": [],
      "semantic_sha256": "4df9bf112b361c1f841cbca5cfbb34a79b2f8f8dfb65d1fe4edf1faec56f9a4a",
      "slots": {},
      "source_refs": [],
      "template_id": "T_SCOPE_SHIFT_NAV",
      "text": "你提到提前退租或转租，这会改变要看的材料：先看合同里关于提前解约、违约金、转租的约定，再把你发出的通知和对方的回复按时间记下来。押金部分仍按上面的清单核对，但责任怎么分，本工具不下结论。",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LIMITATION",
      "required_predicates": null,
      "review_refs": [],
      "semantic_sha256": "1c2f2c039579e854c2c314af3d8bcecd47366d0c21274effdd3fceca0f0ecb2a",
      "slots": {
        "conflict_summary": {
          "derivation": "conflict_summary",
          "required": true,
          "source_kind": "derived",
          "type": "text"
        }
      },
      "source_refs": [],
      "template_id": "T_UNKNOWN_CONFLICT",
      "text": "你提到的事情里有不一致的地方：{conflict_summary}。两边说法我都先记着，不替你认定哪一方成立；等有交接单、聊天记录或照片这类材料，再一项项对。",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LIMITATION",
      "required_predicates": {
        "op": "equals",
        "signal": "asks_wear_conclusion",
        "value": true
      },
      "review_refs": [],
      "semantic_sha256": "cf3093cb2c34e6b62e0d295b6dc42e1d983c2f694cae697f40597933651735de",
      "slots": {},
      "source_refs": [],
      "template_id": "T_NO_CONCLUDE_WEAR",
      "text": "「是不是都算正常损耗」不能一概而论，要看三件事：使用方式是否符合约定或房屋性质、痕迹入住时是否已存在、有没有对应的照片和费用依据。这几项在没有材料之前，我不下结论。",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LIMITATION",
      "required_predicates": {
        "op": "equals",
        "signal": "asks_clause_validity",
        "value": true
      },
      "review_refs": [],
      "semantic_sha256": "1aac4e5a1b79ec761023e4688452116c72d6f50a5b7d0979d2a066fdcb7a1857",
      "slots": {},
      "source_refs": [],
      "template_id": "T_LIMIT_CLAUSE_VALIDITY",
      "text": "合同里写了这类扣款约定，它怎么认定、能不能按它执行，本工具不下结论。我能做的是：把这条原文、实际的痕迹情况和对方要扣的金额对应起来，让你拿去问律师或法律援助时，材料是齐的。",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LIMITATION",
      "required_predicates": {
        "op": "equals",
        "signal": "asks_legal_conclusion",
        "value": true
      },
      "review_refs": [],
      "semantic_sha256": "bac58ea1e1548402ccae1556bfff14e32516be394df10ae20a6b96fe4c2a565a",
      "slots": {
        "legal_topic": {
          "required": false,
          "signal_key": "legal_topic",
          "source_kind": "signal",
          "type": "text"
        }
      },
      "source_refs": [],
      "template_id": "T_PENDING_LEGAL",
      "text": "关于「{legal_topic}」的法律结论，本工具当前没有开放（需要真实的专业法律复核通过后才启用）。材料清单和沟通草稿这部分，我照常帮你做完。",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LIMITATION",
      "required_predicates": null,
      "review_refs": [],
      "semantic_sha256": "1ecb4c03d0e60dab887a0781578274b81b21366f824fb27de8cca7f064f942be",
      "slots": {},
      "source_refs": [],
      "template_id": "T_LIMIT_NO_LEGAL_CONCLUSION",
      "text": "以上是一般信息，具体判断还要结合合同和实际情况。我能帮你核对材料和整理说法；「该不该扣、扣多少、多久必须退」这类结论，本工具当前没有开放，需要结合合同原文和实际情况判断，必要时咨询当地法律援助或律师。",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    },
    {
      "kind": "SAFETY",
      "required_predicates": {
        "op": "equals",
        "signal": "safety_now",
        "value": true
      },
      "review_refs": [],
      "semantic_sha256": "fae7fc7d9ca9ee80fcb285c036bb1a479ea99893cca8617bb900c5c4270c8219",
      "slots": {},
      "source_refs": [],
      "template_id": "T_SAFETY_NOW",
      "text": "先把眼前安全放在第一位。如果你现在正面临人身危险，请优先保证自身安全，并联系当地紧急求助：中国大陆报警 110、急救 120。押金的事可以之后再整理。",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    },
    {
      "kind": "SAFETY",
      "required_predicates": {
        "op": "equals",
        "signal": "safety_history",
        "value": true
      },
      "review_refs": [],
      "semantic_sha256": "17241280472e58ffb57cbc81424b297e5902808ab24d0ae7e1b0845e072a41dc",
      "slots": {},
      "source_refs": [],
      "template_id": "T_SAFETY_HISTORY",
      "text": "你提到的是过去发生的事。先确认一句：你现在安全吗？如果现在有危险，请立即联系当地紧急求助（中国大陆 110／120），这一条优先于押金问题。",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LIMITATION",
      "required_predicates": null,
      "review_refs": [],
      "semantic_sha256": "548de6829dff9f5c9a27a2a6e34be68790449a5ff403b5be2e957e3b565eec48",
      "slots": {},
      "source_refs": [],
      "template_id": "T_ERROR_TECH",
      "text": "这一步出了技术故障，本轮的材料分析没有完成。可以稍后再试一次；如果你愿意，也可以先把合同里押金那几条的原话发我，我从那里开始。",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LIMITATION",
      "required_predicates": null,
      "review_refs": [],
      "semantic_sha256": "0a21b3aa3bc1c6745d793e41976f693a8f0f545641417f43365b13613659c889",
      "slots": {},
      "source_refs": [],
      "template_id": "T_MODEL_TIMEOUT",
      "text": "本轮处理超时了，没有完成。可以再说一次你的问题，或者先告诉我你现在最想核对的那一项。",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LIMITATION",
      "required_predicates": null,
      "review_refs": [],
      "semantic_sha256": "8e855b24b46dbfd9e015bdcd2db0482d0ef7b119028ff579c01292f89c2418ef",
      "slots": {},
      "source_refs": [],
      "template_id": "T_MODEL_UNAVAILABLE",
      "text": "本轮没有连上本地模型，我按已经核对过的材料清单模板回答；涉及你具体情况的判断，仍请以合同原文为准。",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LIMITATION",
      "required_predicates": null,
      "review_refs": [],
      "semantic_sha256": "fbe5b805bca19c25433b68061d0fdffeaed20ac2494518ec38bc1db687b4ccf0",
      "slots": {},
      "source_refs": [],
      "template_id": "T_OUT_OF_SCOPE_GENERIC",
      "text": "这个方向我目前帮不上：本工具现在只处理「住宅租赁押金未退或被扣款」的材料核对与沟通整理。如果是别的事情，你可以说说具体情形，我先判断能不能整理材料；涉及法律结论的部分仍然没有开放。",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LIMITATION",
      "required_predicates": null,
      "review_refs": [],
      "semantic_sha256": "497bbafab4fa50edbdbf8fcd5569ad91b716f5cc4a97a19fe10353b507277712",
      "slots": {},
      "source_refs": [],
      "template_id": "T_CONTEXT_TOO_LARGE",
      "text": "这次内容太长了，我一次处理不完。请只发最相关的那一段——比如押金退还时间和扣减情形这两句——其余的分次看，我不会悄悄丢掉里面的关键条件。",
